        "question_text": "<p>What is the interior angle of a regular hexagon?</p>",
        "question_image": null,
        "answer_image": null,
        "explanation": "<p>The formula for the interior angle of a regular <i>n</i>-sided polygon is $((n-2) \\times 180\u00b0) / n$. For a hexagon ($n=6$), the interior angle is $((6-2) \\times 180\u00b0) / 6 = 120\u00b0$.</p>",
        "reference_passage": null,
        "novel": null,
        "comments_count": 0,
